    "title": "There's a lefty slugger not named Ohtani atop latest Hitter Power Rankings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "20 minutes ago There's a left-handed slugger atop our latest Hitter Power Rankings, but it's not the one that you're used to seeing at No. 1. Shohei Ohtani has occupied the top spot in each of our first two Hitter Power Rankings of the year. That's not the case this time, amid somewhat of a slump on the hitting side for the generational two-way superstar. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
